<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ほじゃこゲーム</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #f0f8ff;
      padding-top: 50px;
      user-select: none;
    }
    h1 { color: #333; }
    #score {
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ff6347;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    button {
      font-size: 24px;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 5px #2e7d32;
    }
    button:active {
      box-shadow: 0 2px #2e7d32;
      transform: translateY(3px);
    }
    .shop {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>ほじゃこクリッカー</h1>
  <p>ボタンをタップしてポイントを貯めよう！</p>
  <div id="score">0 pt</div>
  <button onclick="addPoint()">タップ！</button>

  <div class="shop">
    <p>★ 将来ここにStripeの課金ボタンを置けます ★</p>
  </div>

  <script>
    let score = 0;
    function addPoint() {
      score += 1;
      document.getElementById('score').innerText = score + ' pt';
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
